# a discarded phase adds no type, and an arena without a phase interns final types at once
# RUN(DISCARD): arena-merge discard
# RUN(SERIAL): arena-merge serial
# DISCARD: new types 0 from 4 tasks
# SERIAL: new types 1 without a phase
# SERIAL-NEXT: same id twice: ok
# SERIAL-NEXT: final at once: ok
